        "value": "外　三千八百五十六石六斗三升四合二勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "外（ほか）三千八百五十六石六斗三升四合二勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Additional yield beyond the assessed gross = 3,856.6342 koku. Added to the 32,000-koku 草高 this gives 35,856.6342, against the printed 合高 of 35,856.63402; the two agree through the 合 place and differ only in the final character, which prints 勺 here and 才 in the total — a typesetting slip in the 1928 edition."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "外"
